counterfactuals.output:
**An apparatus comprising:**

a voltage divider coupled to an alternating-current supply and configured to produce a divided voltage representative of a voltage of the alternating-current supply;

sensing circuitry coupled to the voltage divider and configured to generate first and second output signals based at least in part on the divided voltage;

a normally closed switch; and

a controller operatively coupled to the sensing circuitry and the normally closed switch, the controller being configured to cause the normally closed switch to transition from a closed state to an open state in response to receipt of the first output signal.
